        "title": "Enchanting Religious Experience ",
        "text": "This is most important reason for many Indians to visit Nepal. This temple on the bank of river Bagmati is world famous and is frequented by many Hindus for religious purpose. It has four gates and the main gate of temple opens at 4am but all four gates of main temple open at 9 am only for few hours. Apart from Pashupati main deity there are many small statues of other Hindu gods especially Bhairav Ji which is huge and unique in the world. People do religious ceremonies on the banks of river as cremations are on the premises of the temple.",
